add('proofTitle','为什么这两项足够？','Why are both checks sufficient?')
add('proof1','角点抵消不是只凭图形猜测。把平面沿所有输入边界划成小格，并取任一格内部的点 q。只数 q 左下方的角点（x≤q.x 且 y≤q.y）：对于一块砖，q 在砖内时恰有 1 个角点满足；在砖外时有 0、2 或 4 个。因此这些角点总数的奇偶，等于 q 的覆盖次数的奇偶。偶数次出现的角点可成对删掉，所以只需 corners。这就是二维前缀异或：统计左下方标记数是否为奇数。','Corner cancellation has a precise reason. Split the plane along every input edge and choose a point q inside any resulting cell. Count corners southwest of q (x≤q.x and y≤q.y). One tile contributes exactly 1 such corner when q is inside it, and 0, 2, or 4 when outside. Thus the parity of this corner count equals the parity of q’s coverage count. Even-occurrence corners cancel in pairs, so corners alone determines it. This is a 2D prefix XOR: asking whether the number of southwest markers is odd.')
add('proof2','若 corners 只剩外框四角，那么每个外框内部小格都与一个完整大矩形有相同奇偶性，覆盖次数必为 1、3、5…，不可能为 0。所有砖都在外框内；再要求面积和等于外框面积，就没有多余面积留给 3、5…，因此每格必须恰为 1。这证明充分性。','If corners contains exactly the box corners, every interior cell has the same coverage parity as one solid box: 1, 3, 5,…, never 0. All tiles lie within the box. Requiring equal total area leaves no extra area for counts 3, 5,…, so every cell must have count 1. This proves sufficiency.')
add('proof3','反过来，恰好覆盖的面积必等于外框面积；它的角点奇偶也必与大矩形一致。因为每个坐标标记都能从相邻四格的前缀奇偶恢复（把四个奇偶值再做异或），相同的覆盖奇偶必给出相同角点集合。这证明必要性。边界线上允许相接；以上证明考察的是有正面积的小格内部。','Conversely, an exact cover has the box’s area and the same coverage parity as the box. Each corner marker can be recovered from the four adjacent cells’ prefix parities (XOR those four values), so equal coverage parity forces equal corner sets. This proves necessity. Shared boundary lines are allowed; the argument concerns interiors of cells with positive area.')
add('parityTrap','只检查四角也不够：同一个单位正方形重复三次，每个角出现 3 次，仍留下四角，但覆盖次数是 3，面积 3≠1。因此两个条件各自都不可省。','Checking only corners also fails: three copies of the same unit square give each corner 3 occurrences, leaving four odd corners, but coverage is 3 and area 3≠1. Neither condition can be omitted.')
add('p3','这一步要回答：新输入 [0,0,3,1]、[0,1,1,2]、[2,1,3,2]、[0,1,1,2]，哪项检查能发现问题？外框是 3×2；注意最后一块与第二块重复。先自己算面积与奇数角点（出现奇数次的坐标），再选择并揭晓。','For the new input [0,0,3,1], [0,1,1,2], [2,1,3,2], [0,1,1,2], which check finds the problem? The box is 3×2; the last tile duplicates the second. Calculate area and odd corners (coordinates occurring an odd number of times), then choose and reveal.')
