add('incorrect','再比较两个条件。','Compare the two conditions again.')
add('answer','面积 3+1+1+1=6 等于外框面积，所以面积检查通过。左上格覆盖 2 次、中上格 0 次。重复的两块角点互相抵消，剩下底部长条与右上小块，奇数角点为 {(0,0),(0,1),(2,1),(2,2),(3,0),(3,2)}，多出接缝角点且缺少 (0,2)，因此四角集合检查失败，结果 false。选项一忽略面积相等，选项三忽略空洞与重叠。','Area 3+1+1+1=6 equals the box area, so the area check passes. Top-left coverage is 2 and top-middle is 0. The duplicate tiles’ corners cancel, leaving the bottom strip and top-right tile. Odd corners are {(0,0),(0,1),(2,1),(2,2),(3,0),(3,2)}: extra seam corners and missing (0,2). The corner check fails, giving false. Option one overlooks equal area; option three overlooks the gap and overlap.')
add('p4','这一步要回答：如何把两项证据写成可提交的 Python？下面是官方 Python3 接口 Solution.isRectangleCover，返回 bool。浏览器图是模拟；下方源码才是离线测试所执行的提交实现。','How do the two pieces of evidence become submittable Python? Below is the official Python3 interface Solution.isRectangleCover, returning bool. The browser diagram is a simulation; this source is the submission implementation executed in offline tests.')
add('mapping','min_x、min_y、max_x、max_y 保存已处理砖的外框；area 保存面积和；corners 保存出现奇数次的角点坐标。图中处理 B 的 (1,0) 时，if point in corners 为真，所以 remove；(2,1) 不在集合中，所以 add。expected 是最终外框四角；return 同时比较面积与整个集合，不能仅比较集合大小是否为 4。','min_x, min_y, max_x, max_y store processed bounds; area stores the area sum; corners stores coordinates occurring an odd number of times. For B’s (1,0) in the diagram, if point in corners is true, so remove runs; (2,1) is absent, so add runs. expected is the final box’s four corners. return compares both area and the entire set, not merely whether its size is 4.')
add('cost','n 是砖数。每块只更新四个边界、一个面积和四个集合成员，Python 集合用哈希值（从坐标计算出的定位整数）查找元素，操作期望 O(1)，所以总时间期望 O(n)，额外空间 O(n)，最多保留 4n 个角点。无排序，不修改输入。教学图另存完整帧、历史和小格，不代表提交空间。','n is the number of tiles. Each tile updates four bounds, one area and four set entries. Python sets locate entries using hash values (integers computed from coordinates). Operations take expected O(1), giving expected O(n) time and O(n) auxiliary space, with at most 4n corners retained. There is no sorting or input mutation. The tutorial additionally stores full frames, history and cells; these are not submission space.')
add('bounds','单块正面积矩形必为 true；负坐标不影响差值；边或角相接允许，但只在角上接触的两块通常不是矩形。重复砖会计入面积多次。最大外框面积为 4×10¹⁰，超过 32 位整数；Python 整数精确，不取模。官方保证非空且宽高为正，本实现依赖该合同；没有额外定义空输入。','A single positive-area rectangle is true; negative coordinates do not change the differences. Edge or corner contact is allowed, but two tiles touching only at a corner usually do not make a rectangle. Duplicate tiles contribute area repeatedly. The maximum box area is 4×10¹⁰, exceeding 32-bit integers; Python integers are exact, with no modulus. This implementation relies on the official nonempty, positive-dimension input contract; empty input is not additionally defined.')
